---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const updated = "November 8, 2026";
---

<BaseLayout title="Now" description="What I'm up to these days.">
  <h1 class="text-title mb-2">Now</h1>
  <p class="opacity-50 text-sm mb-8 sm:mb-12">Updated {updated}</p>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      On Thursdays and Fridays I'm at <a
        href="https://radome.io"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer">Radome</a
      >, where I'm interning. I work on the web platform, the part people
      actually use to handle their compliance.
    </p>

    <p>
      The rest of the week I study databases, and mostly PostgreSQL. I'm
      digging into how it works under the hood.
    </p>

    <p>
      In the evenings I'm slowly going through <em>L'Art invisible</em>, and
      I'm watching <em>Dark</em>. I'm at the point where I need a notebook to
      keep track of who is whose father.
    </p>

    <p>
      Every Sunday I go walk in the forest. No phone, no music, nothing. Just
      me and the trees for a few hours. It has become the part of the week I
      look forward to the most.
    </p>

    <p>
      I'm also trying to get my Bulgarian back. My parents speak it to me and I
      understand pretty much everything, but when it's my turn to talk, I
      struggle to hold a long conversation. So I'm working on that, one
      sentence at a time.
    </p>
  </div>
  <p class="opacity-50 text-sm mt-12">
    This is a <a class="prose-link" href="https://nownownow.com/about"
      >now page</a
    >.
  </p>
</BaseLayout>
